            <div xml:id="d723">

                <pb facs="0779" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1174</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Marye</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-06">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">November 5, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11:45 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Russian Government officially notifies Embassy that it has placed mines in zone
                    from 58° 50’ north latitude and to east of twenty-first meridian, also at
                    entrance of Gulf of Riga and around Åland Islands and consequently entrance and
                    exit of Finnish and Riga gulfs forbidden.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marye</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
